# tool scratch output
#
# Written into the working tree by tooling, never source. Ignored by name rather
# than with a broad `.*` rule, because `.prettierrc`, `.npmrc`, `.nvmrc` and
# `.prettierignore` are all tracked deliberately and a blanket pattern would hide
# them. `pnpm format` reads this file via `--ignore-path`, so an entry here is
# also what keeps the repo-wide format gate green — a gate that goes red for
# reasons unrelated to the code stops being read. (LAI-031)
.playwright-mcp/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# os / editor noise
.DS_Store
